"""BUILD_SPEC item RPS-1: report tables and the standard report catalogue.

04 ids created: E-65 ``disclosure_kind`` and E-66 ``evidence_pack_kind`` with their values (04 §18
rules 5 and 6); E-67 ``run_status`` (revision 0037) and E-98 ``control_result`` (revision 0020)
exist.

- T-RPT-01 ``report_definition`` (IM-A, RLS-NONE-G, PT-N; §14.2 SELECT to ``erev_app``):
  ``ux_report_definition__current``, the 04 check ``ck_report_definition__kind`` and the checks
  ``__version``, ``__output_formats``, ``__tie_outs`` (table 10-T), ``__parameters_schema`` and
  ``__ipe_logic``. DB-01. Seeded with the 56 version-1 definitions of
  ``erev_api.domain.reports.catalogue.DEFINITIONS`` (DG-MIG-07). A revision may not import a domain
  module (DG-LAY-03), so the seed is the literal ``REPORT_DEFINITION_SEED``, which the unit and pg
  tests compare with ``catalogue.seed_statement()`` and ``DEFINITIONS`` (L4-2-Q-27).
- T-RPT-02 ``report_run`` (IM-S, RLS-T): ``ux_report_run__no``, ``ix_report_run__code`` and the
  checks ``ck_report_run__output_format``, ``__row_count`` and ``__parameters``; the foreign
  keys to ``report_definition (code, version)``, ``period_lock``, ``engine_release``,
  ``file_object`` (output and manifest) and ``job``. DB-03 ``tg_report_run__transition``: once
  SUCCEEDED or FAILED only SC-M changes.
- T-RPT-03 ``disclosure_snapshot`` (IM-A, RLS-TE on ``entity_id``):
  ``ix_disclosure_snapshot__period`` and the check ``ck_disclosure_snapshot__data``; the foreign
  keys to ``legal_entity``, ``period``, ``period_lock`` and ``report_run``. DB-01.
- T-RPT-04 ``evidence_pack`` (IM-S, RLS-T): ``ux_evidence_pack__no``, the 04 checks
  ``ck_evidence_pack__close``, ``__sample``, ``__change`` and ``__access``, and the 04 date check
  named ``ck_evidence_pack__date_range``; the foreign keys to ``legal_entity``, ``period``,
  ``period_lock``, ``file_object`` and ``job``. DB-03 ``tg_evidence_pack__transition``: once
  SUCCEEDED only SC-M changes.

The keys ``lock_snapshot.report_run_id`` (04 §18 rule 2) and ``reconciliation.report_run_id``, which
the CLO-2 revision left for T-RPT-02, are added here (DG-MIG-03; L4-2-Q-24). Two functions are
added.
"""

